@SPACE_ID = {{__SPACE_ID__}}
@TOKEN = {{__TOKEN__}}

### Create an invite

POST {{host}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: {{__SESSION_AUTH_HEADER__}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetType": "SPACE",
  "targetId": "{{__SPACE_ID__}}",
  "role": "VIEWER"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("__TOKEN__", response.body.token);
%}

### List invites created by current user

GET {{host}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: {{__SESSION_AUTH_HEADER__}}

### Accept an invite

POST {{host}}/api/v1/invites/{{TOKEN}}
Authorization: {{__SESSION_AUTH_HEADER__}}

### Delete / revoke an invite

DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/invites/{{TOKEN}}
Authorization: {{__SESSION_AUTH_HEADER__}}
